  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan asks Lang Ya land spirit whether a related offer is the legendary familiar face, Lang Ya refuses that immortal move and names Attitude Gu as its core Gu, saying Fang Yuan could not use familiar face even if he received it. Lang Ya will pay immortal essence stones at market rates and hand over unfamiliar face if Fang Yuan enslaves a strong desolate beast for Lang Ya blessed land.",
